      "id": "teach_8",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The shortcut above breaks if only some values change.\n\nSuppose five numbers average 24. Their total is 120. If four of the five numbers rise by 3, the total rises by 4 × 3 = 12, not by 5 × 3.",
